# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore, perf, ci, build, revert
# Scope: auth, api, db, ui, n8n, executions, prompts, assets, docker, config
# Subject: imperativo, sem ponto, max 72 chars
#
# [corpo opcional] - explicar POR QUE, nao O QUE
# [footer opcional] - Breaking Changes, Closes #issue
#
# Exemplos:
#   feat(auth): login com credenciais
#   fix(api): retorno 500 no callback do n8n
#   refactor(db): extrair queries para modulo separado
#   docs(readme): instrucoes de setup local
#   chore(deps): atualizar drizzle-orm
